msgid "Example 2: T1/T2 thermal relaxation {#example-2-t1t2-thermal-relaxation}"
msgstr "Halimbawa 2: T1/T2 thermal relaxation {#example-2-t1t2-thermal-relaxation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now consider a more realistic error model based on thermal relaxation with the qubit environment:\n"
"* Each qubit is parameterized by a thermal relaxation time constant $T_1$ and a dephasing time constant $T_2$.\n"
"* Note that we must have $T_2 \\le 2 T_1$.\n"
"* Error rates on instructions are determined by gate times and qubit $T_1$, $T_2$ values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Isaalang-alang naman natin ang isang mas makatotohanang error model batay sa thermal relaxation kasama ang kapaligiran ng qubit:\n"
"* Ang bawat qubit ay may mga parameter na thermal relaxation time constant na $T_1$ at dephasing time constant na $T_2$.\n"
"* Pansinin na kailangan nating magkaroon ng $T_2 \\le 2 T_1$.\n"
"* Ang mga error rate sa mga instruction ay tinutukoy ng mga oras ng gate at mga halaga ng $T_1$, $T_2$ ng qubit.\n"

